cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Powerlog in your work, please cite the following paper."
title: Powerlog
abstract: >-
  A lightweight harness that measures the CPU and GPU energy consumed by an
  unmodified program.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/arsho/powerlog"
url: "https://powerlog.readthedocs.io"
keywords:
  - energy
  - power
  - profiling
  - gpu
  - cpu
  - nvml
  - rocm
  - sycl
  - rapl
  - hpc
# Author of the Powerlog software. The paper that should be cited when using
# Powerlog is listed under preferred-citation below.
